 was born six weeks premature in January 2017, and her fight to survive grabbed international attention. She initially could not stand on her own and weighed just 13.2kg at birth, 11.3kg less than the lowest recorded birth weight for her species. Fans followed her progress online, and she became so popular that books were written about her. She also inspired a line of beer, all sorts of clothing and an ice cream flavour. One couple even got engaged in front of her exhibit, with Fiona getting into the picture while underwater in the background. AP", "stages_full": {"windows": {"windows": 10, "cap": 12, "pct_body_read": 100, "offsets_text": [[99, 329], [330, 545], [545, 746], [747, 985], [986, 1188], [1189, 1365], [1366, 1599], [1600, 1789], [1790, 2006], [2006, 2010]]}, "scan_dates": {"spots": {"attribution": 8, "change": 1, "date": 2, "entity": 23, "event": 2, "modal": 2, "negation": 1, "quantity": 3, "quote": 2}, "dates": [["Nov 16", "2026-11-16"], ["January 2017", "2017-01"]], "dates_resolved": 2, "anchor": "2026-11-18", "time_proxy": {"label": "time_proxy", "marker": "PROVISIONAL", "offset_days": [-2], "n": 1, "of": "resolved date minus published date, in days"}}, "facts": {"kinds": {"amount": 5, "date": 2, "name": 23, "triple": 39}, "stated": 54, "unbound": 15, "invalid": 0, "stated_amount": 5, "stated_date": 2, "quarantined": 0, "held": [], "items": [{"kind": "amount", "s": 653, "e": 658, "text": " 13.2", "status": "stated"}, {"kind": "amount", "s": 1620, "e": 1625, "text": " 13.2", "status": "stated"}, {"kind": "amount", "s": 1637, "e": 1642, "text": " 11.3", "status": "stated"}, {"kind": "amount", "s": 616, "e": 619, "text": "six", "status": "stated"}, {"kind": "amount", "s": 1468, "e": 1471, "text": "six", "status": "stated"}, {"kind": "date", "s": 1115, "e": 1121, "text": "Nov 16", "status": "stated"}, {"kind": "date", "s": 1491, "e": 1503, "text": "January 2017", "status": "stated"}, {"kind": "name", "s": 0, "e": 14, "text": "Cincinnati Zoo", "status": "st